  "question": {
    "text": "The resistance of a conductivity cell containing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MKCl</mi></math> solution at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1750</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>. If the conductivity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MKCl</mi></math> solution at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math><br />is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>152</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, then the cell constant of the conductivity cell is____<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "266",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For KCl solution, R = 1750 ohms</p><p>Conductivity, K =<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>152</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>K=<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Cell constant,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>XR</mi></math>=<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>152</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1750</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>266</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>cm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
